set rulebase security rules "Block Bad" category any
set rulebase security rules "Block Bad" application any
set rulebase security rules "Block Bad" service any
set rulebase security rules "Block Bad" action deny
set rulebase security rules "Block Bad" log-end yes
set rulebase security rules "Block Bad" disabled yes
set rulebase security rules "Block Bad" description "FWSHIFT: disabled by the converter, see the report."
